  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the reactions (in the given stoichiometry of the reactants) in List-I with one of their products given in List-II and choose the correct option.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(P)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(1)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>)</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>OCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(Q)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(2)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(R)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(3)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(S)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(4)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>POCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>(5)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>"
